      - family-names: Sandhu
        given-names: Parkirat
      - family-names: Shemet
        given-names: Roman
      - family-names: Lee
        given-names: Justin H.
    year: 2026
    url: https://github.com/cactus-compute/needle
    license: MIT
    notes: >
      The current Needle model, and the default target of this runtime. Design
      and ablations: arXiv:2607.18363. The architecture, training, and weights
      are entirely the work of Cactus Compute; needle-rs is a deployment
      runtime for them.
  - type: software
    title: "Needle: A 26M-Parameter Tool-Calling Transformer"
    authors:
      - family-names: Ndubuaku
        given-names: Henry
      - name: "Cactus Compute"
    year: 2026
    url: https://github.com/cactus-compute/needle
    license: MIT
    notes: >
      Needle v1, still supported by this runtime alongside v2. Cite this one if
      your work uses the v1 weights specifically.
